%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogues_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 95b4cff7b78839970ae88c3ff464b6cb, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 21030430009675776
    m_Localized: This can't be happening... this can't be happening... where did
      I drop it? If I don't get this package delivered, Don Cucho is going to have
      my head...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430018064384
    m_Localized: Huh? Oh, hey, kid. Sorry, I didn't see you. I'm a bit desperate
      today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430018064385
    m_Localized: Hello. You seem... worried. What happen?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430018064386
    m_Localized: I dropped a package from my bag and I don't even know where. It
      had an Aniki Magazine and an Italian Completo inside. Don Cucho ordered it
      for his grandson, and if I don't deliver today, they'll dock my pay... again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430018064392
    m_Localized: Ah, it's you again. How's the search going? I'm on edge here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430018064393
    m_Localized: I search. Still not find the two things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430018064394
    m_Localized: Easy, easy... but hurry, okay? Don Cucho must have been waiting
      for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258688
    m_Localized: 'Remember: the Aniki Magazine and the Italian Completo. Both. There
      was all sorts of stuff in the sewers, so check the chests carefully.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258689
    m_Localized: Chests... bugs... one of those things have what's missing. I keep
      searching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258690
    m_Localized: I come back when I have everything. Or... when nothing left to check.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258691
    m_Localized: That's it, that's it. And don't get into trouble searching, okay?
      Thanks again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258692
    m_Localized: And now what? Another kid with offers? No, no, no, I'm not buying
      anything, my stall is full...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258693
    m_Localized: No sell. I bring package. From... the mail man.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258694
    m_Localized: The mail man? That one who drops everything? Let's see, let's see...
      My Aniki Magazine! And the Italian Completo!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258695
    m_Localized: "My grandson has been waiting all morning for this. The magazine
      is what he wanted most, you know? It's anime, one of those they bring from
      Valpara\xEDso."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258696
    m_Localized: Magazine... Aniki. Yes. I hear of that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258697
    m_Localized: Here, kid, so you can buy yourself something. It's not much, but
      it's from the heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258698
    m_Localized: Thank you. I... happy to help. The mail man also going to be happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258699
    m_Localized: Tell him to be more careful next time, okay? And that he doesn't
      lose my completo again, my grandson doesn't forgive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258700
    m_Localized: Is it possible? A day without dropping anything... well, it's still
      early.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258701
    m_Localized: Ah, it's you, kid! So? Did you deliver it? Did Don Cucho receive
      you well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258702
    m_Localized: Yes. He receive package. He happy. His grandson... also happy, I
      think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258703
    m_Localized: What a relief! You saved my job, really. I don't know how to thank
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258704
    m_Localized: No need thank. I help. That is all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258705
    m_Localized: You're a good person, kid. If you ever need something from the mail...
      well, I can't promise much, but we'll see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258706
    m_Localized: And hey... if you see Don Cucho around, tell him next time the completo
      goes with more care. But don't tell him I said that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258707
    m_Localized: I don't know what to do anymore... I spent the whole morning looking
      for that package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258708
    m_Localized: Don Cucho is going to look at me badly when I pass by his stall.
      And he's right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258709
    m_Localized: Maybe someone else will find it. Or maybe not. I mean, who's going
      to want an old magazine and a cold completo?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21030430022258710
    m_Localized: I better keep going with my route. Sooner or later the embarrassment
      will pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653638922240
    m_Localized: So... you need those things again. I help. I search.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116544
    m_Localized: I'm sorry. I can't help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116545
    m_Localized: Really? You'd do that for me? I don't even know your name, kid...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116546
    m_Localized: Package lost near the sewers... Maybe the things are in chests.
      Or in the hands of bugs. I go look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116547
    m_Localized: Look, if you find them, take them straight to Don Cucho. He has
      a stall here in the market. I'd be grateful for life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116548
    m_Localized: Understood. I deliver package to Don Cucho.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116549
    m_Localized: Ah... I see. I understand. Don't worry, kid. It's not your problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116550
    m_Localized: I'll figure something out... Maybe I can find someone else to help.
      Or maybe not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038653643116551
    m_Localized: Take it easy, take it easy. Have a good day, kid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038696454377472
    m_Localized: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21038700971642880
    m_Localized: Reject
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
